                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "640bb9fe-5190-36db-85e8-34ffd95b98f5",
                                        "entry_id": "2952a3ba-515d-366b-be3d-08d555609268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A number of things that follow on one after the other or are connected one after the other."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4708ab15-090a-4257-9974-966ed254380a",
                                                "sense_id": "640bb9fe-5190-36db-85e8-34ffd95b98f5",
                                                "text": "A series of seemingly inconsequential events led cumulatively to the fall of the company."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07bfda78-839b-45d6-a176-bb084fc33c30",
                                                "sense_id": "640bb9fe-5190-36db-85e8-34ffd95b98f5",
                                                "text": "When Timothy and Julia hurried up the staircase to the bedroom floor, where a considerable commotion was taking place, Tim took Barry Leach with him.[…]. The captive made no resistance and came not only quietly but in a series of eager little rushes like a timid dog on a choke chain."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96ae0f87-9dc9-460d-b5d0-8fad57ce21b4",
                                                "sense_id": "640bb9fe-5190-36db-85e8-34ffd95b98f5",
                                                "text": "Seeing the British establishment struggle with the financial sector is like watching an alcoholic […]. Until 2008 there was denial over what finance had become. When a series of bank failures made this impossible, there was widespread anger, leading to the public humiliation of symbolic figures."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85904c46-cbd5-38d2-ac0c-344c5caa0cb5",
                                        "entry_id": "2952a3ba-515d-366b-be3d-08d555609268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A television or radio program consisting of several episodes that are broadcast at regular intervals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62e0f109-5c43-4927-bf55-fb0e1e74756e",
                                                "sense_id": "85904c46-cbd5-38d2-ac0c-344c5caa0cb5",
                                                "text": "“Friends” was one of the most successful television series in recent years."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad88b946-9974-34eb-a67e-0fe37a6696f0",
                                        "entry_id": "2952a3ba-515d-366b-be3d-08d555609268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of season (“one of the groups of episodes that together make up a whole series”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ebfafbf-dee6-4493-8c9c-13f8f84c11d9",
                                                "sense_id": "ad88b946-9974-34eb-a67e-0fe37a6696f0",
                                                "text": "I enjoyed the third series of “Friends”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "435e15cf-4e22-3426-a5c7-6c43c7cb6505",
                                        "entry_id": "2952a3ba-515d-366b-be3d-08d555609268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The sequence of partial sums ∑ᵢ₌₁ⁿa_i of a given sequence aᵢ."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f295c65-c7ff-4a32-908b-f280fc6b2a87",
                                                "sense_id": "435e15cf-4e22-3426-a5c7-6c43c7cb6505",
                                                "text": "The harmonic series has been much studied."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff848772-7b0f-3705-ad8e-3b29c1707d08",
                                        "entry_id": "2952a3ba-515d-366b-be3d-08d555609268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of matches between two sides, with the aim being to win more matches than the opposition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce43f741-b669-432d-84d8-951637ce7805",
                                                "sense_id": "ff848772-7b0f-3705-ad8e-3b29c1707d08",
